    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In DSC 16: Anastasia's Secret Language, Quinn Dombrowski talks with Anastasia Salter about the history of computer games, particularly in the 1990's. Quinn's kids, Sam and Paul Dombrowski, try out the 1990's Baby-Sitters Club game and offer color commentary.",
